WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.375 --> 00:00:04.833
Sera...

2
00:00:04.833 --> 00:00:05.375
que...

3
00:00:05.458 --> 00:00:06.375
¿Qué es esto?

4
00:00:09.666 --> 00:00:10.833
